I hope this is the right place to report a bug against
aboot-installer [1] (which is not in debian proper as
alpha is currently a non released architecture).

It depends on chroot, which doesn't exist as an udeb (busybox
provides a chroot applet).

It seems that this 'Depends:' field is just a copy from grub-installer
[2], which removed this dependency soon afterwards [3].

